{"kind":"sentence","lang":"zh-hans","entities":{"191708":{"renderings":[{"id":"c271b835f714e311","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"3630304"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"我们的飞机飞到了云上。","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"192220":{"renderings":[{"id":"a1c654aee5455e98","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"2031451"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"火箭飞得极快。","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"202571":{"renderings":[{"id":"5210fbf1b6e515dc","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"677652"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"燕子飞得非常快。","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"2535477":{"renderings":[{"id":"d5cb762ff4f64fdd","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13894369"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":{"value":"那一天，整日听著寂寥的笔声度过。其间，时不时也能听到啾啾的鸣叫声。他想，文鸟或许也是因寂寞才啼鸣的吧。然而走到廊簷一看，牠正在两根栖木之间，忽而飞往那边，忽而飞回这边，来来回回，片刻不停。丝毫看不出有什么不满的样子。","derivedFrom":{"value":"那一天，整日聽著寂寥的筆聲度過。其間，時不時也能聽到啾啾的鳴叫聲。他想，文鳥或許也是因寂寞才啼鳴的吧。然而走到廊簷一看，牠正在兩根棲木之間，忽而飛往那邊，忽而飛回這邊，來來回回，片刻不停。絲毫看不出有什麼不滿的樣子。","lang":"zh-hant","transform":"script:hant-to-hans"}},"direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"6855708":{"renderings":[{"id":"72bd6bbd8e6a85ce","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"6857050"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"虽然宇宙尘埃被认为不是很危险，但就算是极小的颗粒，以数倍于子弹的速度飞来的话，也可能造成受伤。","direction":"fromJapanese"}]}}}